Subject: [PATCH] fix(server): release consumed event replay pages (#10777)

---
 .../Layers/OrchestrationEventStore.test.ts    | 51 +++++++++++++
 .../Layers/OrchestrationEventStore.ts         | 76 ++++++++-----------
 2 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

